id: DRAFT-geojson-cpp-0.5.1-cppinfo-requires-transitive-includes
trigger_tool: conan|cmake|cxx
phase: packaging
error_signature: fatal error: 'mapbox/geometry.hpp' file not found|fatal error: '.*\.hpp' file not found|FIND_DEPENDENCY_NAMES.*empty|no matching package.*transitive
severity: 2
category: conan, packaging, headers, build-system
match_keywords: cpp_info.requires, CMakeDeps, transitive, include, find_dependency, test_package, header-only, package_info
title: flat conanfile 配方缺失 cpp_info.requires 转发导致下游 CMakeDeps 不生成传递依赖配置、消费者编译缺头文件
root_cause: 配方 requirements() 声明了 mapbox-geometry/mapbox-variant/rapidjson 等头文件依赖，但 package_info() 未通过 cpp_info.requires 转发依赖目标；下游 test_package/消费者使用 CMakeDeps 时，geojson-cpp-config.cmake 的 FIND_DEPENDENCY_NAMES 为空，未 find_dependency(mapbox-geometry)，generators 目录甚至不生成 mapbox-geometry-config.cmake，消费者编译期无依赖 include 路径
affected_scope: 头部无条件 include 第三方依赖头文件的 C/C++ 库配方（mapbox 生态、header-only 依赖链等），Conan 2 + CMakeDeps 消费路径
verification_cmd: conan create 内 test_package 编译通过；generators/ 目录出现 mapbox-geometry-config.cmake 与 FIND_DEPENDENCY_NAMES 非空
rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: cppinfo-requires-forwarding-plus-explicit-test-requires
rec_description: package_info() 增加 self.cpp_info.requires = ["mapbox-geometry::mapbox-geometry", "mapbox-variant::mapbox-variant", "rapidjson::rapidjson"]（依赖的 cmake 包名::目标名），使 CMakeDeps 生成传递配置；test_package 同时显式 find_package 并链接全部传递依赖（与 mapbox-geometry 自身 test_package 同模式）
rec_command: conanfile.py package_info() 声明 cpp_info.requires；test_package/CMakeLists.txt 显式 find_package(mapbox-geometry/mapbox-variant/RapidJSON) + target_link_libraries
rec_auto_fix: true
rec_impl: conan-recipe-plus-test-package
fallback_priority: 2
fallback_approach: explicit-consumer-requires
fallback_description: 若不想改配方转发，消费者侧 requirements() 显式 requires 全部传递依赖并显式链接；覆盖但不如转发干净
fallback_auto_fix: false
forbid_1_pattern: cpp_info\.libs\s*=\s*\[.*\]\s*$ 后无 cpp_info.requires
forbid_1_reason: 仅声明 libs 不转发头文件依赖，消费者仍缺 include 路径
forbid_1_consequence: test_package 编译失败 fatal error 头文件 not found，任务退回修复循环
similar_to: []
doc_file: knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-geojson-cpp-0.5.1-cppinfo-requires-transitive-includes.md
last_updated: 2026-09-23
source_event: geojson-cpp/0.5.1 test_package 编译失败 mapbox/geometry.hpp not found，补 cpp_info.requires + 显式依赖后通过
authors: hmbs-executor
source_pr: pending
